# BLR-CommuteOptimizer v2 — Environment Variables
# Copy to .env.local — NEVER commit .env.local
#
# TWO SEPARATE API KEYS REQUIRED:
#
# 1. GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY (server-side only — NEVER in client code)
#    APIs to enable: Directions API
#    Restrictions:   IP address restricted (your Vercel function IP range)
#                    OR no restriction + Directions API only
#    Used by:        api/commute.js (Vercel serverless function)
#
# 2. PUBLIC_MAPS_KEY (client-side — safe to expose, heavily restricted)
#    APIs to enable: Maps JavaScript API + Places API only
#    Restrictions:   HTTP referrers: your domain + localhost
#                    API restrictions: Maps JavaScript API + Places API ONLY
#    Used by:        index.html (Places Autocomplete widget)
#    Set in:         GitHub Secret PUBLIC_MAPS_KEY (injected by deploy.yml at build time)
#
# Both keys created at: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials

GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_private_directions_api_key_here
PUBLIC_MAPS_KEY=your_public_places_api_key_here
